Z||000000||RossT||10-19-2001||12:24 AM||||Has anyone put gt exhaust tips on a formula? My formula has the regular tips and would like to put the gt ones on.  I also notice that the gt tips have different part #'s for different years.  Thanks..<P>Ross||||reg||1
